OL,3,GNEWSAReplacement bridge arrives at
OL,4,Anature reserve
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork to dismantle an unsafe footbridge
OL,7,Fat a nature reserve is set to begin
OL,8,Fafter its replacement arrived on site.
OL,10,FThe Works Bridge at Attenborough Nature
OL,11,FReserve, near Beeston in
OL,12,FNottinghamshire, was closed in April
OL,13,F2023 after a safety inspection.
OL,15,FPlans to demolish and replace the
OL,16,Fstructure, which forms part of an
OL,17,Fexisting bridleway, were approved by
OL,18,FBroxtowe Borough Council in September,
OL,19,Fwith the entire project expected to
OL,20,Fcost #375,000.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
