OL,3,GNEWSAReplacement bridge arrives at
OL,4,Anature reserve
OL,5,
OL,6,FIts new 25-tonne replacement, which was
OL,7,Fbuilt in Wigan, arrived at the site in
OL,8,Ftwo sections on Monday. It will be
OL,9,Fassembled and lifted into place after
OL,10,Fthe old bridge is removed on Tuesday.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
